{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017xnxZXFE3uF3wqE13ygdrg","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: «WORKSPACE»/specs/spec.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb","uuid":"c16a7d76-cf09-444c-88d0-2823229566f9","timestamp":"2026-09-17T05:59:53.093Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"«WORKSPACE»/specs/spec.md","content":"# Dark Mode Toggle\n\n## Summary\n\nAdd a dark-mode toggle to the settings page. The choice is stored per-user in their profile and applies across all their logged-in sessions and devices.\n\n## Behavior\n\n- Settings page exposes a theme control with three states: **System**, **Light**, **Dark**.\n- Default for a user with no stored preference is **System**, which follows the OS/browser setting via `prefers-color-scheme`.\n- While set to System, changing the OS setting updates the app theme live, without a reload.\n- Selecting Light or Dark pins the theme and overrides the system setting.\n- Changes apply immediately on selection; no separate save step.\n\n## Persistence\n\n- Preference field on the user profile: `theme` — one of `system` | `light` | `dark`, defaulting to `system`.\n- Saved server-side on change and loaded with the user's profile at session start.\n- A local cache of the value is applied before first paint to avoid a flash of the wrong theme.\n\n## Out of Scope\n\n- Per-device overrides that diverge from the profile setting.\n- Scheduled or automatic time-of-day switching.\n- Custom themes beyond light and dark.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false}}
